<title>UK: BayerLB sets 250 mln guilder bond.</title>
<headline>BayerLB sets 250 mln guilder bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers ABN AMRO Hoare Govett and Bayerische Landesbank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   BAYERISCHE LANDESBANK GIROZENTRALE</p>
<p> AMT    250 MLN DFL   COUPON     4.875     MATURITY    28.DEC.01</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.395   PAY DATE  L-15.NOV.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.875     REOFFER    99.77     SPREAD	+8 BP</p>
<p> NOTES	L LONG FIRST COUPON</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    AMST	PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) 5-50-1M   SALE LIMITS US/UK</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    =	   HOME CTRY  GERMANY   TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.25	SELL CONC  1.625     PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND SEPTEMBER 2001 DSL -- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
